<title>JAPAN: Nissho Iwai climbs on provider hopes.</title>
<headline>Nissho Iwai climbs on provider hopes.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Nissho Iwai Corp climbed in Thursday afternoon trade due to hopes that its on-line provider subsidiary will prove profitable, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0459 GMT, the share was up 14 yen at 507 with 4.46 million shares traded. It was the fourth most heavily traded issue on the first section of the Tokyo bourse.</p>
